### Pokemon by name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pokemon/clefairy

### Create favorite
POST http://localhost:8080/api/collection
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pokemonName": "pikachu",
  "nickname": "Mein Starter"
}

### Get all favorites
GET http://localhost:8080/api/collection

### Get favorite by id (UUID einsetzen)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/collection/{{id}}

### Update nickname
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/collection/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "Arena-Champion"
}

### Delete favorite
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/collection/{{id}}